  id: 87
  missionName: THE MEANING OF THE SEAL
  missionType: INVESTIGATION
  briefing: The chamber's carvings are the Seal's instructions, if anyone can put
    them in order. Fumi says the fortress's lists match them. Kagehira's vanguard
    is already on the stair.
  debrief: Kagehira has the third key. He has had it for a year. He needs the door,
    and the door needs a Kurogawa.
